  "prefLabel": "He-C 6340.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 6340.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to identify the qualifications and performance requirements to become a provider of adoptive report writing services, which includes adoptive history reports and adoptive home study reports, for the division for children, youth and families (DCYF) as required by RSA 170-G:4 XVIII and RSA 170-B:18.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for He-C 6340) #9264, eff 9-20-08; ss by #12059, eff 12-6-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-c6300.html"
}
